sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kernel/eBPF
    participant P as packetparser Plugin
    participant E as Enricher
    participant M as Metrics Module
    participant PR as Prometheus

    Note over K,P: 1. eBPF Attachment Phase
    K->>P: Load eBPF programs (EndpointIngress/Egress, HostIngress/Egress)
    P->>P: Attach clsact qdisc to pod veth & host interfaces
    P->>P: Subscribe to endpoint events (pod creation/deletion)

    Note over K,P: 2. Packet Capture Loop
    loop Continuous
        K->>K: Parse packet (Ethernet/IP/TCP/UDP headers)
        K->>K: Extract IPs, ports, TCP flags, timestamps
        K->>K: Optional: conntrack metrics, sampling
        K->>P: Send via BPF_MAP_TYPE_PERF_EVENT_ARRAY
    end

    Note over P: 3. Kernel-to-Userspace Transfer
    par Producer (handleEvents)
        K->>P: perf_event_output()
        P->>P: readData() reads from perf array
        P->>P: Lost events tracking
        P->>P: Buffer records (channel size: 10000)
    end

    Note over P: 4. Flow Processing (processRecord workers)
    par Consumer (2 workers)
        P->>P: Binary decode raw packet data
        P->>P: Convert to Cilium Flow protobuf
        P->>P: Add metadata (traffic direction, TCP flags, packet size)
        P->>P: Add TCP metadata (seq, ack, tsval, tsecr)
        P->>P: Increment ParsedPacketsCounter
    end

    Note over P,E: 5. Enrichment
    P->>E: Write Event with Flow
    E->>E: Lookup Kubernetes context
    E->>E: Add: pod name, namespace, workload, service
    E->>P: Return enriched Flow

    Note over P,M: 6. Metrics Processing
    P->>M: Forward enriched Flow to metrics modules
    par Parallel metrics processing
        M->>M: forward.go: adv_forward_count, adv_forward_bytes
        M->>M: tcpflags.go: TCP flag counters
        M->>M: drops.go: Dropped packet metrics
        M->>M: tcpretrans.go: TCP retransmissions
        M->>M: latency.go: API server latency
        M->>M: dns.go: DNS request/response
    end

    M->>PR: Export Prometheus metrics